## Candidate-survival and omission audit

Polysantol is absent because live inventory marks it depleted. Ebanol survives only as a stock-corrected control approximation: compare V8-E (610 uL of 4.918033% v/v Ebanol/DPG, nominal 30 uL Ebanol + 580 uL DPG) against V8-0 (610 uL DPG) at constant total. This isolates the Ebanol approximation without claiming equivalence to Polysantol. Cardamom, lavender, all transition rows and the sole Ethylene Brassylate musk stay unchanged. The full modeled OAV<1 survival ledger will be inserted after the fresh governed run; until then every survival inference is HOLD.

