Live inventory read 2026-09-02: Polysantol is depleted; liquid Ambrofix is non-executable; Bacdanol and Guaiacwood EO 33% are quantitative HOLD; Benzyl Salicylate and lost tinctures are excluded. Ethylene Brassylate, Cardamom EO, Bontoux Lavender, Virginia cedar, Ebanol and the listed current rows are owned/resolvable. Givaudan AIMI is neat but exact grade physics remains HOLD. V7's owned Caraway 10% DEP is deliberately excluded because this control preserves accepted V6, not rejected V7.

